{"id":115694170181074,"name":"[UPD] Mine ⛏️","desc":"Welcome to Mine, the most relaxing mining game on Roblox! ⛏️\n\nStep into the world of Mine, where skill, strategy, and discovery drive your journey. Dig through layers of rock, uncover legendary and unique ores, and piece together the mysteries hidden beneath the surface! Currently there are 200,000+ different variations of minerals. There is more than enough to uncover!\n\nHow To Mine?:\n- Hold out your pickaxe inside of a mine and hold down [LMB] on a block\n- Stop holding when your moving bar is close to the white bar. Try to get it as close as possible!\n- It's okay if you miss a few times! It takes practice.\n- The closer you get to the white bar, the greater your damage & reward once broken!\n\nRedeem codes in the settings menu! (Gear at the top right of your screen/[M] for PC)\n\nCredits to:\n• @Timpy23 - Creator / Developer\n• @ReViVeDzz - Music & OST\n• All QA Testers & Contributors involved\n• Special thanks to you for playing!\n\nInspired by Fisch & Azure Mines","path":"/game/115694170181074-mine","slug":"115694170181074-mine","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/80b0e3e95e52b50b4d74fb5305469d3e8a4c01bffac96c1c1041b012f3aba892.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e95c3040677b9369231fa926f479e6c4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1377589,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-13T07:43:31.243Z","creator":{"name":"Hurb Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6822f8238614c9a9e41acafc","title":"Auto Perfect","game":{"_id":"680898b08335c1f558d07928","gameId":115694170181074,"name":"[UPD] Mine ⛏️","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"115694170181074-mine","path":"/game/115694170181074-mine","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":115694170181074},"slug":"EVENT!-Mine-Auto-Perfect-39798","ve